content:
Na Salomo yɛɛ nneɛma a wɔde siesie Onyankopɔn Asɔredan no mu nyinaa:

    sikakɔkɔɔ afɔrebukyia;
    apono a wɔde Hyiadan mu Burodo no gu so;

Ɛberɛ a Israelfoɔ nyinaa hunuu sɛ ogya no reba fam, na Awurade animuonyam rehyɛ Asɔredan no ma no, wɔn nyinaa hwehwee fam de wɔn anim butubutuu hɔ, sɔree Awurade kamfoo no sɛ,
  “Ɔyɛ;
    na nʼadɔeɛ wɔ hɔ daa!”
